  "id": "038",
  "title": "Rank C Immortal",
  "subtitle": "\"I awakened with a healing class in a world where healers died first. My party was led by an arrogant Rank S warrior who had buried three of us already. I was going to be the fourth.\"",
  "penName": "Nadia Kiernan",
  "genre": "litrpgSystem",
  "hook": "I awakened with Class: Healer (Rank F) in a system that killed healers fastest. My party was assigned by the Academy. The leader was Kael Vane, a Rank S Sword-Saint who had buried his last three healers — two by monster claws and one by her own hand after he got her killed. He looked at my class sheet. He said I could leave at the next town. I did not leave. I leveled three times in the first dungeon. He said nothing. By the second dungeon, I had a reputation. By the third, so did he.",
